#UI BMS 4.38 update, April 2023, by Kolbe

#This is the toolbar at the bottom of the TE Play Window.

#It contains:
#- OOB
#- ATO
#- Briefing
#- Loadout
#- Flight Plan
#- Datacard
#- Take Off

